Asterisk base image recipe

The files in this directory that build the image (Dockerfile, build.sh, entrypoint.sh, healthcheck.sh) derive from
the Asterisk Docker build recipe by Andrius Kairiukstis, published at https://github.com/andrius under the
repository name "asterisk" (the Dockerfile and scripts its generator renders for Debian trixie, at commit
8d9e9559652122a0a9d3cffc6515c7e5cb8c8095). They are used under the MIT License below.

Asterisk itself, and the pjproject it bundles, are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2; they
are not part of this directory. The image is built from the official, unmodified release tarball, and
/usr/share/doc/verbara-asterisk-base/SOURCE.txt inside it names that tarball, its sha256 and the recipe commit.

The Digium codec_opus binary is not downloaded and not part of the image.

